

  %sort ℕ %.
`nat` is a easier way to type `ℕ`
  %symbol nat ℕ %.
## Basic Definitions
  %scope nat %{

`0` is a natural number
        %term 0 nat %.
`S` is a natural number
        %term S %pi nat %-> nat %.
`1` is a natural number
        %inline 1 (S 0) %.
`2` is a natural number
        %inline 2 (S 1) %.
  %}
